#: ../../index.rst:9
msgid ""
"The ROCm OpenSHMEM (rocSHMEM) is an intra-kernel networking library that "
"provides GPU-centric networking through an OpenSHMEM-like interface. It "
"simplifies application code complexity and enables finer communication "
"and computation overlap than traditional host-driven networking. rocSHMEM"
" uses a single symmetric heap allocated to GPU memories. For more "
"information, see :doc:`introduction`."
msgstr ""

